    {
      "text": "from thence is the shepherd, the stone of Israel, Gen. 49:24 (D&C 50:44). He is the Rock, Deut. 32:4. lightly esteemed the Rock of his salvation, Deut. 32:15. neither is there any rock like our God, 1 Sam. 2:2. Lord is my rock, 2 Sam. 22:2. Rock of Israel spake to me, 2 Sam. 23:3. Lord is my rock, and my fortress, Ps. 18:2. who is a rock save our God, Ps. 18:31. my rock … the God of my salvation, Ps. 18:46 (1 Ne. 15:15; 2 Ne. 4:30; 9:45; Jacob 7:25). lead me to the rock that is higher than I, Ps. 61:2. He only is my rock, Ps. 62:6. stone which the builders refused is become the head stone, Ps. 118:22 (Matt. 21:42; Luke 20:17). a rock of offence to both the houses of Israel, Isa. 8:14. not been mindful of the rock of thy strength, Isa. 17:10. rock whence ye are hewn, Isa. 51:1 (2 Ne. 8:1).",
